      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </BackstoryDef>
  <BackstoryDef>
    <defName>HE_Kemet_BS_Medjay</defName>
    <title>medjay scout</title>
    <titleShort>medjay</titleShort>
    <description>[PAWN_nameDef] patrolled the desert roads with the medjay, tracking thieves across rock and sand. [PAWN_pronoun] can run all day and still shoot straight at sunset.</description>
    <slot>Adulthood</slot>
    <spawnCategories>
