    <title>incense trader</title>
    <titleShort>trader</titleShort>
    <description>[PAWN_nameDef] led donkey caravans to the southern lands for incense, ebony and ostrich feathers, and came back with all of them and most of [PAWN_possessive] donkeys.</description>
